  "body": "## Download VerseView Detector\n\nChoose the download for your computer under **Assets** below.\n\n| Computer | App download |\n| --- | --- |\n| Windows 64-bit | `VerseView-Detector-Windows-x64.zip` |\n| Mac with Apple Silicon (M-series) | `VerseView-Detector-Mac-Apple-Silicon.tar.gz` |\n| Mac with an Intel processor | `VerseView-Detector-Mac-Intel.tar.gz` |\n\nExtract the archive before opening the app. On Windows, keep the extracted app folder together.\n\n**Beta:** production signing/notarization and remaining physical microphone, visible VerseVIEW\noutput and Windows UI acceptance are incomplete. The original intermittent delivery incident remains unresolved.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Technical details and SHA256 checksums</summary>\n\nSource commit: `c014bedd127a388fb9263dd5ab30b010845c52f0`\n\nBuild verification reports are retained with the GitHub Actions artifacts.\n\n```text\ndcf8f71e81fd9323ddccfa7816eafe04481f23563544d60e79725fbb9dfe9c55  VerseView-Detector-Mac-Apple-Silicon.tar.gz\nf527c64b12eaa226798a21eb53dc157a1a88f91a1342eff941ff8131763c6591  VerseView-Detector-Mac-Intel.tar.gz\n9e23b8e9a5b9fd63c194683fe001a04d966a1559974dc41bc81a1178fc2f7f67  VerseView-Detector-Windows-x64.zip\n```\n\n</details>\n\nOriginal technical reports are preserved in [release evidence](https://github.com/KevinAwesomeCoding/VerseView-Detector/tree/main/docs/evidence/releases/desktop-beta-233-1).\n"
